cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this dataset, please cite it using the metadata below."
title: "PMXT Behavioral Clusters v1 — Non-Retail Polymarket Microstructure Dataset"
authors:
  - family-names: Nechepurenko
    given-names: Maksym
    affiliation: "Devnull Research / ForesightFlow"
    email: maksym@devnull.ae
abstract: >
  Per-cluster and per-tier aggregate behavioral statistics from a 13.36M fill
  empirical run on the Polymarket CTFExchange (Polygon mainnet) over 2026-04-21
  to 2026-04-27, together with per-market microstructure metrics (PR, TS, OI,
  VPIN, Kyle's λ, SCI) and resolution-anchored informed liquidity scores (ILS
  at 4 anchor offsets). 43,116 markets, 77,203 addresses, k-means k=5 behavioral
  partition and feature-tier classification (6 tiers). Bundle 3 of the PMXT
  family; companion to Paper 4 of the Event-Linked Perpetuals research programme.
